{
  "rationale": "The plant automata separate sensing (obstacle detection) and motion actuation. The specification automata enforce safe, coverage-biased exploration: forward/random_walk in clear, recovery with move_backward or directed turn on obstacle, and only use full_rotate as a last-resort scan after repeated blockages. All uncontrollable events are total in every state, and controllable actions are one-shot per commit state. The design avoids oscillations and ensures steady progress.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to modularize perception and actuation.",
    "Specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-maximizing actions, enforce recovery before resuming exploration, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors."
  ],
